[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3499575215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112468#issuecomment-3499575215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112468","id":3499575215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ql0ev","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T22:09:54Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T22:09:54Z","body":"Theres a suggestion from @shakesoda that it’s related to the division by res.a","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3499575215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3499835360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112468#issuecomment-3499835360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112468","id":3499835360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Qmz_g","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T23:33:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T23:33:41Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.6.dev https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/cb3af5afff15669a684ba4f04b9aa5c70dfd09ad.\n\nNote that the issue is much less prominent on the main menu. Here, only the floor is brightened somewhat:\n\n4.6.dev2 | 4.6.dev https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/cb3af5afff15669a684ba4f04b9aa5c70dfd09ad\n-|-\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08ec763d-1e45-481b-a928-e8e29b0aa788) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0cdf0423-6416-455f-a4bb-7247b99d31cf)\n\nDisregard the issue with broken character animation, it's unrelated (but is also seen in the 3D platformer demo).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3499835360/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3504080775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112468#issuecomment-3504080775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112468","id":3504080775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q3AeH","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T18:16:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T18:20:09Z","body":"I found our problem\n\n<img width=\"385\" height=\"49\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aef0e35a-5cf3-4aa2-b171-aecc3ba38968\" />\n\nLooking through the lights in the scene, the lowest value I found was 5000. That is completely absurd. The slider only goes up to 16 which is already an extremely high value.\n\nIt seems like an extremely low density was used along with a super high volumetric fog energy on the lights to basically allow for having almost no fog in dark areas and a faint fog in light areas. I'll see if we can recover the same look using proper blending equations and reasonable values for volumetric fog energy","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3504080775/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3504377057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112468#issuecomment-3504377057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112468","id":3504377057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q4Izh","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T19:09:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T19:09:52Z","body":"Alright, after doing some more investigation and fixes, everything makes sense now. \n\nThe problem with the old method is that we were multiplying the volumetric fog color by its opacity twice. For very heavy fog, that wasn't a problem, but for very sparse fog it resulted in it being way too dark (and hence having the dark borders around the edges of fog volumes as reported in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101514)\n\nIn the TPS demo, we have the fog density set to an extremely low value: `0.0001`. This results in a very low opacity value, which gets multiplied _twice_ which fully suppresses the fog. To counteract that, the demo used extremely high light energy multipliers making lights 5-15 **thousand** times stronger in volumetric fog than they are in the scene. This was required just to make the fog visible. \n\nUsing a higher density value and weaker light multipliers can achieve the same effect (see https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo/pull/212). \n\nMy suggestion to fix this bug is to update the TPS demo with more reasonable volumetric fog values and to clean up our Volumetric Fog blending code further to use the correct values everywhere. \n\nUltimately, this will change behaviour for some users. When using default values it should look roughly the same. For most users the difference will not be very noticeable. The only people who will be severely impacted are people like us who have pushed the values to the extreme. But IMO this is a spacebar heating situation (https://xkcd.com/1172/) and we need to prioritize fixing the bug over maintaining 100% compatibility. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3504377057/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3504918151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112468#issuecomment-3504918151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112468","id":3504918151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q6M6H","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T20:56:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T20:56:32Z","body":"Yeah if the TPS demo was doing something extreme to exploit a bug, it makes sense to me to fix that demo instead of reverting a bugfix.\n\nWe should make sure that the compat breakage is documented in the migration guide, so users who may have done similar hacks understand why their projects break and how to fix them. I put [#112494](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112494) on the documentation tracker so we don't forget.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3504918151/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]